    <entry>
      <title>飞书存储空间使用总结</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/28/p-6/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/28/p-6/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="飞书清理功能"><a href="#飞书清理功能" class="headerlink" title="飞书清理功能"></a>飞书清理功能</h3><p>和飞书官方人员沟通了一下，清理聊天文件完全是一个闭源的操作：</p><ul><li>不支持api操作</li><li>不支持api访问</li><li>系统不自带定时任务</li><li>需要手动创建清理任务</li><li>清理数据后会对调查取证能力(灰度)产生影响，清理的文件会丢失</li><li>容量上限提示只能推给个人，无法推送给管理员</li><li>当云端数据清理后，本地的历史消息也会被清理</li></ul><h3 id="清理注意点"><a href="#清理注意点" class="headerlink" title="清理注意点"></a>清理注意点</h3><p>1、特殊岗位的不能清理，</p><ul><li>财务</li><li>法务</li><li>审计</li><li>HR</li><li>采购</li><li>销售</li><li>高层（老板）</li></ul><p>2、清理前，上报领导</p><p>3、定期清理，1-3个月一次</p><p>4、只清理离职的，获取离职1年半的</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>bevy学习有感</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/28/p-5/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/28/p-5/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="学习心得"><a href="#学习心得" class="headerlink" title="学习心得"></a>学习心得</h3><p>概括几点学习bevy遇到的问题：</p><ul><li>rust语法太复杂，上手一个基本案例需要学习10多种rust语法结构</li><li>bevy的编译过程太耗费时间和电脑内存，而且编译器本身不带编译工具需要安装额外的编译工具</li><li>vscode的rust语法分析器每次修改完成代码都要分析很久才会出现代码提示</li><li>bevy官方提供的第一个案例不是游戏引擎案例而是ECS模型案例，后续需要单独耗费大量的时间去学习游戏引擎</li><li>学习bevy既要学习rust语法，还要学习编译器优化</li></ul><h3 id="环境搭建"><a href="#环境搭建" class="headerlink" title="环境搭建"></a>环境搭建</h3><p>Visual Studio 依赖组件：</p><ul><li>MSVCv143 - VS 2022 C++x64&#x2F;x86生成工具(最新)</li><li>Windows 10 SDK (10.0.19041.0)</li></ul><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 创建rust项目</span></span><br><span class="line">cargo new my_bevy_game</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> my_bevy_game</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 添加依赖</span></span><br><span class="line">cargo add bevy</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 运行</span></span><br><span class="line">cargo run</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 编译</span></span><br><span class="line">cargo build <span class="literal">--release</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="ECS-系统结构源代码展示"><a href="#ECS-系统结构源代码展示" class="headerlink" title="ECS 系统结构源代码展示"></a>ECS 系统结构源代码展示</h3><figure class="highlight rust"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">use</span> bevy::prelude::*;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// rust特性宏，告诉Bevy这个结构体可以作为ECS组件使用</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#[derive(Component)]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">struct</span> <span class="title class_">Person</span>; <span class="comment">// Person 是空结构体，没有字段，作用是标记实体</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#[derive(Component)]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">struct</span> <span class="title class_">Name</span>(<span class="type">String</span>); <span class="comment">// 有一个字段，是一个 元组结构体（tuple struct）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 计时器类型</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#[derive(Resource)]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">struct</span> <span class="title class_">GreetTimer</span>(Timer);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">main</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// App::new() → 调用 App 类型的关联函数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// .add_systems(...) → 在 App 上调用方法</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// .run() → 启动应用</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    App::<span class="title function_ invoke__">new</span>()</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_ invoke__">add_plugins</span>(DefaultPlugins)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 在你的应用中注册插件</span></span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_ invoke__">add_plugins</span>(HelloPlugin)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_ invoke__">run</span>();</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">hello_world</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// print 宏</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// println!(&quot;hello world!&quot;);</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">add_people</span>(<span class="keyword">mut</span> commands: Commands) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// Rust 字符串分两种：&amp;str（借用）、String（拥有所有权，可变）</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// &quot;Elaina Hume&quot; 是 &amp;str，需要 .to_string() 转成 String</span></span><br><span class="line">    commands.<span class="title function_ invoke__">spawn</span>((Person, <span class="title function_ invoke__">Name</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Elaina Proctor&quot;</span>.<span class="title function_ invoke__">to_string</span>())));</span><br><span class="line">    commands.<span class="title function_ invoke__">spawn</span>((Person, <span class="title function_ invoke__">Name</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Renzo Hume&quot;</span>.<span class="title function_ invoke__">to_string</span>())));</span><br><span class="line">    commands.<span class="title function_ invoke__">spawn</span>((Person, <span class="title function_ invoke__">Name</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Zayna Nieves&quot;</span>.<span class="title function_ invoke__">to_string</span>())));</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// mut → 可变</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// mut query → 允许修改 query</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// for mut name → 循环里的 name 可修改</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// &amp;mut → 可变引用</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// &amp;mut Name → 拿到 Name 的可变引用，可以修改里面的值</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// &amp; / &amp;mut → 是否可变引用</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// Rust 的泛型语法 &lt;T&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// Query&lt;&amp;Name, With&lt;Person&gt;&gt; → 取 Name 组件，但只匹配有 Person 的实体</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// With&lt;T&gt; → Bevy 查询过滤器</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">update_people</span>(<span class="keyword">mut</span> query: Query&lt;&amp;<span class="keyword">mut</span> Name, With&lt;Person&gt;&gt;) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> <span class="title class_">mut</span> name <span class="keyword">in</span> &amp;<span class="keyword">mut</span> query &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 访问元组结构体的第 0 个字段</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 因为 struct Name(String) 是元组结构体，里面只有一个字段</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// break → 退出循环，因为只需要修改第一个匹配的名字</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> name.<span class="number">0</span> == <span class="string">&quot;Elaina Proctor&quot;</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            name.<span class="number">0</span> = <span class="string">&quot;Elaina Hume&quot;</span>.<span class="title function_ invoke__">to_string</span>();</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">break</span>; <span class="comment">// We don&#x27;t need to change any other names.</span></span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">greet_people</span>(time: Res&lt;Time&gt;, <span class="keyword">mut</span> timer: ResMut&lt;GreetTimer&gt;, query: Query&lt;&amp;Name, With&lt;Person&gt;&gt;) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> timer.<span class="number">0</span>.<span class="title function_ invoke__">tick</span>(time.<span class="title function_ invoke__">delta</span>()).<span class="title function_ invoke__">just_finished</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">for</span> <span class="variable">name</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> &amp;query &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">println!</span>(<span class="string">&quot;hello &#123;&#125;!&quot;</span>, name.<span class="number">0</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 创建你的第一个插件</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">pub</span> <span class="keyword">struct</span> <span class="title class_">HelloPlugin</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">impl</span> <span class="title class_">Plugin</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> <span class="title class_">HelloPlugin</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">build</span>(&amp;<span class="keyword">self</span>, app: &amp;<span class="keyword">mut</span> App) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        app.<span class="title function_ invoke__">insert_resource</span>(<span class="title function_ invoke__">GreetTimer</span>(Timer::<span class="title function_ invoke__">from_seconds</span>(<span class="number">2.0</span>, TimerMode::Repeating)));</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// add things to your app here</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        app.<span class="title function_ invoke__">add_systems</span>(Startup, add_people);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 元组 (a, b) → Rust 的简单组合类型</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// .chain() → Bevy 提供的函数，把多个系统按顺序链起来执行</span></span><br><span class="line">        app.<span class="title function_ invoke__">add_systems</span>(Update, (hello_world, (update_people, greet_people).<span class="title function_ invoke__">chain</span>()));</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="显示精灵源代码展示"><a href="#显示精灵源代码展示" class="headerlink" title="显示精灵源代码展示"></a>显示精灵源代码展示</h3><figure class="highlight rust"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">use</span> bevy::prelude::*;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">main</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    App::<span class="title function_ invoke__">new</span>()</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_ invoke__">add_plugins</span>(DefaultPlugins)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_ invoke__">add_systems</span>(Startup, setup)</span><br><span class="line">        .<span class="title function_ invoke__">run</span>();</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">fn</span> <span class="title function_">setup</span>(<span class="keyword">mut</span> commands: Commands, asset_server: Res&lt;AssetServer&gt;) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    commands.<span class="title function_ invoke__">spawn</span>(Camera2d);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    commands.<span class="title function_ invoke__">spawn</span>(Sprite::<span class="title function_ invoke__">from_image</span>(</span><br><span class="line">        asset_server.<span class="title function_ invoke__">load</span>(<span class="string">&quot;1.png&quot;</span>),</span><br><span class="line">    ));</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="后记"><a href="#后记" class="headerlink" title="后记"></a>后记</h3><ul><li>Bevy 和 rust 学习门槛高</li><li>ECS系统的这种结构实现的方式值得学习</li></ul>]]></content>
      
      
      
